{"unit_id":"tag:03QT:proof","translation":"我们构造这一函子（functor）的逆（inverse）。在《基本（Fundamental）群（Groups）》引理 <REF_0001> 中已见，给定一个 <MATH_0001>-集合（set）<MATH_0002>，存在平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>，使得 <MATH_0004> 同构（isomorphic）于 <MATH_0005>，作为 <MATH_0006>-集合（set）。考虑层（sheaf）<MATH_0007>，在 <MATH_0008> 上，由规则 <MATH_0009> 定义。这是一个层（sheaf），因为平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）拓扑（topology）是次典范的（subcanonical）。于是得到 <MATH_0010>，作为 <MATH_0011>-集合（sets）（细节略去）。这给出函子（functor）的逆（inverse），从而完成证明。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"Fundamental","target_term":"基本"},{"source_term":"Groups","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"次典范的"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"范畴论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆","context":"范畴等价的逆，待决定。"},{"source_term":"Fundamental","target_term":"基本","context":"来源章名限定词，待决定。"},{"source_term":"Groups","target_term":"群","context":"来源章名核心，待决定。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"群作用的集合，待决定。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"态射及拓扑类型，待决定。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"范畴论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"群作用的同构，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"层论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"景的拓扑，待决定。"},{"source_term":"subcanonica