{"unit_id":"tag:04JL:statement","translation":"定理 <REF_0001> 和《基本（Fundamental）群（Groups）》引理 <REF_0002> 的结论也可表述为：<MATH_0001> 上的每个层（sheaf）都可表示（representable）为概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>，平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）于 <MATH_0003>。这并不意味着每个层（sheaf）都在《景（Sites）》定义 <REF_0003> 的意义下可表示（representable）。原因是，在构造 <MATH_0004> 时，我们选择了一个足够大的（large）集合（set），由概形（schemes）组成，平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）于 <MATH_0005>；而 <MATH_0006> 上的层（sheaves）构成一个真类（proper class）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Fundamental","target_term":"基本"},{"source_term":"Groups","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表示"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表示"},{"source_term":"large","target_term":"大的"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"proper class","target_term":"真类"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Fundamental","target_term":"基本","context":"来源章名限定词，待决定。"},{"source_term":"Groups","target_term":"群","context":"来源章名核心，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"层论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表示","context":"层的可表示性，待决定。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"概形用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"概形性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"来源章名，待决定。"},{"source_term":"large","target_term":"大的","context":"集合大小，待决定。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"集合论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"概形用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"层论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"proper class","target_term":"真类","context":"集合论用语，待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
